WEBVTT

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:03.791
Mother...

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:05.583
It's too dangerous out here, come!

00:00:13.666 --> 00:00:15.583
You must live on.

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.375
After surviving various harsh training,

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:23.917
two outstanding young men

00:00:23.917 --> 00:00:27.625
became the Scarlet Guardians that protect
this very planet.

00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:30.667
One of them Private Yuito Sumeragi.

00:00:33.292 --> 00:00:34.707
The other one

00:00:34.707 --> 00:00:37.167
is Private Nagi Karman.

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:39.125
Right before the memorable graduation ceremony,

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:43.750
the two promising young will display
their true potential to the world!

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:44.875
Nagi.

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:47.875
You talk too much!

00:00:50.542 --> 00:00:52.000
So, you want a real fight!

00:01:17.832 --> 00:01:19.832
Well? Will you surrender now?

00:01:22.917 --> 00:01:24.332
When did you...

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.542
Give me a break! Wait!

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:29.829
I found an opening.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.125
ALARM

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:34.082
THE GRADUATION CEREMONY IS ABOUT TO BEGIN
PLEASE BE HURRY

00:01:34.542 --> 00:01:35.792
The time...

00:01:35.792 --> 00:01:36.667
Oh no!

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:38.667
DANGER ZONE, NO ENTRY

00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:51.375
I am Nagi Karman who will
join the Scarlet Guardians today!

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:52.542
Nice to meet you!

00:01:52.542 --> 00:01:54.917
Stop fooling around!

00:01:54.917 --> 00:01:56.417
What was that?

00:01:57.082 --> 00:01:59.917
Was that the guy?

00:01:59.917 --> 00:02:01.417
No way!

00:02:01.417 --> 00:02:03.082
Up next.

00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:04.667
"THE MUCH ANTICIPATED 567TH CLASS"
Today is the day

00:02:04.667 --> 00:02:08.207
"THE MUCH ANTICIPATED 567TH CLASS"
where the graduation ceremony of OSF begins.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:14.792
All who made it into the OSF are elites that
went through the harsh affinity tests of SAS.

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:21.625
Let's introduce the star recruit of the year.

00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:24.332
This is where my name comes in!

00:02:24.332 --> 00:02:25.582
There he is.

00:02:25.582 --> 00:02:27.582
"FROM A GLORIOUS BACKGROUND, OSF AS HIS GOAL"
Yuito Sumeragi.

00:02:27.582 --> 00:02:30.375
He is the song of Chairman Jo Sumeragi,

00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:33.417
-of the New Himuka Government.
-So it really was you.

00:02:33.417 --> 00:02:34.750
"CHAIRMAN JO SUMERAGI OF NEW HIMUKA COUNCIL"
Yes.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.625
"CHAIRMAN JO SUMERAGI OF NEW HIMUKA COUNCIL"
His ancestor was the founding father.

00:02:36.625 --> 00:02:39.417
He is the prestigious family's hope.

00:02:39.417 --> 00:02:42.167
"KAITO SUMERAGI,  MINISTER OF OSF"
His brother, Kaito Sumeragi

00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:45.625
is the Minister of New Himuka's OSF.

00:02:45.625 --> 00:02:49.667
He gave up his political career
to serve at the front line.

00:02:49.667 --> 00:02:50.500
Indeed.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.667
There has been a concerning report lately.

00:02:53.667 --> 00:02:55.500
According to insider's information,

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.792
Yuito's affinity for power is much lower.

00:02:58.792 --> 00:03:00.500
This is worrying.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.167
Can the prestigious and delicate young man

00:03:02.167 --> 00:03:06.250
survive the harsh battle against the Others?

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:08.832
-This leaves a sour taste in my mouth.
-Next news thread.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.292
Yuito, just ignore those people.

00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:15.125
I don't really mind.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.917
It's a fact the my power is subpar.

00:03:23.792 --> 00:03:25.332
Whatever they say,

00:03:25.332 --> 00:03:27.500
you are part of the OSF from starting today.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:31.957
We both gave it our best to make it this far.

00:03:31.957 --> 00:03:34.832
There is nothing to worry about.

00:03:34.832 --> 00:03:40.207
It's been your dream to join the OSF
since you were a kid.

00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:45.667
Yeah.

00:03:45.667 --> 00:03:47.250
Thanks, Nagi.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.625
You'd better keep this in mind, Yuito.

00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:52.832
ALERT

00:03:59.167 --> 00:04:00.542
OTHERS ALERT

00:04:00.542 --> 00:04:03.707
They just ruined our special day.

00:04:03.707 --> 00:04:06.207
Others alert has been issued.

00:04:06.207 --> 00:04:09.375
The probabilities of attacks for
different areas are as follow...

00:04:47.083 --> 00:04:49.708
The man who crushed the Other in one hit,

00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:52.083
receiver of First Class of Septentrions.

00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:55.541
"MAJOR KAREN TRAVERS, POWER: BRAIN EATER"
brain eater, Karen Travers!

00:04:59.041 --> 00:05:00.416
You're not going anywhere.

00:05:05.875 --> 00:05:07.375
It's Major Spring.

00:05:07.375 --> 00:05:09.958
"MAJOR FUBUKI SPRING, POWER: CRYOKINESIS"
He froze the Other with his cryokinesis!

00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:12.625
Master Fubuki!

00:05:13.208 --> 00:05:14.750
That was amazing.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.500
We have to fight the way they do.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.666
Yeah.

00:05:19.291 --> 00:05:22.333
You must live on.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.875
SCARLET NEXUS

00:06:56.291 --> 00:06:59.875
SCARLET POWER

00:07:02.083 --> 00:07:05.458
Lucky for us, we made it in time.

00:07:05.458 --> 00:07:07.583
We must be waiting for Karen.

00:07:09.041 --> 00:07:11.416
There is a cute girl in our class!

00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:15.875
Naomi Randall. Lovely Naomi.

00:07:15.875 --> 00:07:18.625
And the little girl next to her is...

00:07:18.625 --> 00:07:20.791
They are of the same age.

00:07:20.791 --> 00:07:22.208
Are they twins?

00:07:25.333 --> 00:07:26.750
She is looking at us!

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.375
Don't do it, Sister.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:34.708
Do not show your weakness so easily,
they won't stop pestering you.

00:07:34.708 --> 00:07:40.333
Kasane, you are always
treating me like a little kid.

00:07:41.166 --> 00:07:45.083
By the way, I was looking
at the guy next to him.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.916
A speech from Minister Kaito Sumeragi.

00:07:53.916 --> 00:07:55.541
Everyone, stand up!

00:07:59.041 --> 00:08:01.083
It's your elder brother.

00:08:04.833 --> 00:08:06.458
Only those with a noble ambition

00:08:06.458 --> 00:08:09.666
will be chosen.

00:08:09.666 --> 00:08:13.500
I applaud your courage and passion.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:18.833
In the country that is plagued by
attacks from the Others,

00:08:18.833 --> 00:08:23.083
those from the scout class that has
outstanding power,

00:08:23.083 --> 00:08:27.333
and the volunteer class that must
train to improve their power

00:08:27.333 --> 00:08:28.708
"POWER"
must work as one.

00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:31.666
Without your combined powers,

00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:34.792
you will not overcome the challenges
ahead of you.

00:08:34.792 --> 00:08:39.332
We only know the enemies
come from the Extinction Belt in stratosphere.

00:08:39.332 --> 00:08:41.582
There are still a number of mysteries to solve.

00:08:41.582 --> 00:08:44.875
Which is why those with the powers
to stand against the monsters

00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:47.207
are our first line of defense.

00:08:47.207 --> 00:08:50.500
While you're carrying out your missions,

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.292
do not forget the ambition you hold
in your heart.

00:08:53.582 --> 00:08:55.625
From now on,

00:08:55.625 --> 00:08:59.875
all 2168 of the students here

00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:02.167
will officially become part of New Himuka's OSF,

00:09:02.167 --> 00:09:04.375
the Scarlet Guardians!

00:09:10.875 --> 00:09:11.707
NAGI KARMAN

00:09:14.832 --> 00:09:16.792
YUITO SUMERAGI

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:22.375
I hope I could talk to Naomi.

00:09:22.375 --> 00:09:23.625
Let's go.

00:09:23.625 --> 00:09:25.000
Hurry up!

00:09:27.167 --> 00:09:31.042
How old were you when you were rescued?

00:09:31.042 --> 00:09:32.625
Five years old.

00:09:32.625 --> 00:09:36.082
The women in OSF from back then...

00:09:36.707 --> 00:09:38.082
I found her!

00:09:38.082 --> 00:09:39.457
What?

00:09:39.457 --> 00:09:41.082
Naomi Randall?

00:09:41.082 --> 00:09:43.582
So this is what you've been looking for?

00:09:43.582 --> 00:09:46.207
The eldest daughter of
the noble Randall family.

00:09:46.207 --> 00:09:49.582
The person next to her
was her younger sister, Kasane Randall.

00:09:50.375 --> 00:09:51.417
What is it?

00:09:51.417 --> 00:09:56.582
Kasane's parents were killed
by Others when she was younger.

00:09:56.582 --> 00:09:59.042
The Randalls took her in.

00:09:59.042 --> 00:10:02.042
She became Naomi's sister,
who was at the same age as her.

00:10:02.042 --> 00:10:05.417
She was recruited into OSF
when she was 12 years old.

00:10:05.417 --> 00:10:07.582
She was at the top of
the leaderboard in training.

00:10:07.582 --> 00:10:09.625
Naomi was in fifth place.

00:10:09.625 --> 00:10:12.207
They are totally elites!

00:10:12.207 --> 00:10:15.082
Kasane Randall...

00:10:15.082 --> 00:10:16.875
The Randall family...

00:10:18.792 --> 00:10:22.167
On my father's inauguration ceremony...

00:10:23.207 --> 00:10:28.542
I didn't find anything about
the person who saved you.

00:10:28.542 --> 00:10:29.792
But Yuito,

00:10:29.792 --> 00:10:31.707
there is something I must know.

00:10:33.707 --> 00:10:35.917
You can have Kasane.

00:10:36.417 --> 00:10:38.332
I know she looks a little scary.

00:10:38.332 --> 00:10:40.292
But I will woo Naomi instead.

00:10:41.332 --> 00:10:44.832
Great. Kasane is still the same.

00:10:45.667 --> 00:10:50.832
You mentioned this morning
you had a dream about RED Strings.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:56.667
Do not let go of the RED Strings.

00:10:58.917 --> 00:11:01.292
What kind of a dream was that?

00:11:01.292 --> 00:11:05.167
Was it related to your power?

00:11:05.167 --> 00:11:08.375
I am more worried about you.

00:11:08.375 --> 00:11:11.042
I'm not sure if we would be in the same platoon.

00:11:11.042 --> 00:11:12.832
You are sloppy.

00:11:12.832 --> 00:11:15.207
So I must protect you.

00:11:15.207 --> 00:11:17.417
Kasane, that was mean.

00:11:18.042 --> 00:11:22.707
We still don't know who saved you.

00:11:22.707 --> 00:11:26.167
Not even my brother knows.

00:11:26.167 --> 00:11:27.500
Yuito!

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.332
We are on the same team!

00:11:29.332 --> 00:11:31.917
Hanabi, it's been too long!

00:11:31.917 --> 00:11:33.250
Who is she?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.125
She is my childhood friend.

00:11:35.125 --> 00:11:36.582
Hanabi Ichijo.

00:11:36.582 --> 00:11:37.792
He is Nagi.

00:11:37.792 --> 00:11:39.082
Nice to meet you.

00:11:39.082 --> 00:11:40.667
It's nice to meet you too.

00:11:40.667 --> 00:11:43.292
We didn't see you in training.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:47.167
Well, I was in the scouted.

00:11:47.167 --> 00:11:49.000
I see.

00:11:51.375 --> 00:11:54.292
Welcome to Seto Platoon.

00:11:54.292 --> 00:11:56.250
"CAPTAIN SETO NARUKAMI"
I am Seto Narukami.

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.875
"POWER: ELECTROKINESIS"
I am your captain starting today.

00:11:58.875 --> 00:12:00.167
As you all know,

00:12:00.167 --> 00:12:01.375
starting today,

00:12:01.375 --> 00:12:04.250
we will use the Struggle Arms System, SAS,

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:07.917
to share our powers in the battles
against our enemies.

00:12:07.917 --> 00:12:11.417
New members, please introduce yourselves.

00:12:11.417 --> 00:12:14.667
By the way, my power is electrokinesis.

00:12:14.667 --> 00:12:16.417
"2ND LIEUTENANT HANABI ICHIJO"
I am Hanabi Ichijo.

00:12:16.417 --> 00:12:18.582
"POWER: PYROKINESIS"
My power is pyrokinesis.

00:12:18.582 --> 00:12:20.417
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:12:20.417 --> 00:12:22.207
"PRIVATE NAGI KARMAN"
I am Nagi Karman.

00:12:22.207 --> 00:12:24.542
"POWER: AEROKINESIS"
My power is aerokinesis.

00:12:24.542 --> 00:12:27.125
It's been my dream to join OSF.

00:12:27.125 --> 00:12:28.792
"PRIVATE YUITO SUMERAGI"
I am Yuito Sumeragi.

00:12:28.792 --> 00:12:30.500
"POWER PSYCHOKINESIS"
My power is psychokinesis.

00:12:32.542 --> 00:12:36.542
I was rescued by the OSF as a child.

00:12:36.542 --> 00:12:38.875
I will do whatever I can to repay the kindness.

00:12:39.917 --> 00:12:43.125
The current members should
introduce themselves too.

00:12:43.125 --> 00:12:44.667
Tsugumi.

00:12:44.667 --> 00:12:46.832
"MAJOR TSUGUMI NAZAR"
I am Tsugumi Nazar.

00:12:46.832 --> 00:12:49.707
"POWER: CLAIRVOYANCE"
My power is clairvoyance.

00:12:50.625 --> 00:12:53.375
Well, my power...

00:12:54.332 --> 00:12:57.667
It's hard to show how your clairvoyance work.

00:12:58.457 --> 00:13:00.707
You must be the famous Yuito Sumeragi!

00:13:00.707 --> 00:13:04.167
You are all over the news this morning.

00:13:04.167 --> 00:13:07.917
Everyone was talking about
the Young Master Sumeragi's recruitment.

00:13:07.917 --> 00:13:11.292
Kagero, introduce yourself.

00:13:11.292 --> 00:13:13.417
Yes, Captain.

00:13:13.417 --> 00:13:15.917
"CORPORAL KAGERO DONNE"
Freshmen of the 567th class,

00:13:15.917 --> 00:13:17.917
"POWER: INVISIBILITY"
I am Kagero Donne.

00:13:17.917 --> 00:13:21.500
I am what they called a latent genius.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:23.917
A self-proclaimed genius.

00:13:23.917 --> 00:13:26.957
The captain is always so serious.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.125
Others occurrences have been spotted

00:13:29.125 --> 00:13:31.542
above Suzaku area.

00:13:31.542 --> 00:13:33.375
Seto Platoon and Kyoka Platoon,

00:13:33.375 --> 00:13:34.792
proceed to the area immediately.

00:13:34.792 --> 00:13:36.457
This is too sudden.

00:13:37.167 --> 00:13:40.125
Alert level elevated.

00:13:40.125 --> 00:13:43.457
Combatants, please proceed
to the area immediately.

00:13:49.582 --> 00:13:52.250
Stay calm and go to the bunkers.

00:14:18.125 --> 00:14:21.250
Anti-Others warfare has
eliminated 85% of the Others.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.375
The rest of them are still falling down.

00:14:23.375 --> 00:14:26.332
I haven't introduced myself yet.

00:14:26.332 --> 00:14:28.292
"2ND LIEUTENANT WATARU FRAZER"
I am Wataru Frazer.

00:14:28.292 --> 00:14:30.500
"POWER: TELEPATHY"
My power is telepathy.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.292
I can connect to other people's minds.

00:14:32.292 --> 00:14:34.542
I will provide support from the headquarters.

00:14:34.542 --> 00:14:36.457
Seto Platoon, go to point E.

00:14:36.457 --> 00:14:38.375
Kyoka Platoon, go to point F

00:14:38.375 --> 00:14:39.625
to eliminate the Others.

00:14:40.957 --> 00:14:42.582
This is Seto Platoon.

00:14:42.582 --> 00:14:44.375
Target confirmed.

00:14:44.375 --> 00:14:48.792
Very well! Let's show them
what the Scarlet Guardians are made of!

00:14:48.792 --> 00:14:50.292
Nagi, Yuito.

00:14:50.292 --> 00:14:52.625
You two stand by in the back.

00:14:52.625 --> 00:14:54.000
Wait for reinforcement.

00:14:54.582 --> 00:14:57.332
Do you want to die on your first day at work?

00:14:57.332 --> 00:14:58.125
But...

00:14:58.125 --> 00:14:59.292
This is an order.

00:15:00.625 --> 00:15:03.457
Yes.

00:15:03.457 --> 00:15:04.457
Let's go.

00:15:04.457 --> 00:15:07.082
Take this as a field trip.

00:15:17.332 --> 00:15:21.707
Right. We are only volunteer soldiers.

00:15:41.832 --> 00:15:43.542
We took down two of them!

00:15:46.457 --> 00:15:49.082
Kyoka Platoon arrived.

00:15:49.082 --> 00:15:51.000
Proceed to the battles now.

00:15:59.917 --> 00:16:02.500
That was amazing, Kasane.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.875
Thank you for the support just now.

00:16:04.875 --> 00:16:07.417
Kasane is so cool.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.207
Mom!

00:16:15.207 --> 00:16:16.000
ALERT

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.750
This is...

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:18.792
I'll go.

00:16:18.792 --> 00:16:20.417
Nagi, get us some reinforcement.

00:16:21.332 --> 00:16:23.707
I'll go with you.

00:16:23.707 --> 00:16:24.832
Nagi...

00:16:24.832 --> 00:16:27.625
Fool! Don't look so excited.

00:16:27.625 --> 00:16:29.625
It's not like I have a choice.

00:16:29.625 --> 00:16:32.000
I told you to wait for reinforcement!

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:34.082
What if they didn't make it in time?

00:16:34.082 --> 00:16:36.167
We will go to her rescue now.

00:16:36.167 --> 00:16:38.417
Nagi, you're great.

00:16:38.417 --> 00:16:40.292
I know that all along.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:48.375
Kasane, another wave is coming.

00:16:58.667 --> 00:17:00.457
I made up my mind long ago.

00:17:01.125 --> 00:17:04.333
I want to become a soldier of OSF

00:17:04.333 --> 00:17:06.041
and become like the person who saved me!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:19.458
Come here!

00:17:23.708 --> 00:17:25.666
-Nagi!
-Just go!

00:17:27.791 --> 00:17:29.166
Don't come any closer!

00:17:32.291 --> 00:17:33.375
Nagi!

00:17:42.083 --> 00:17:44.166
-That hurts...
-Are you all right?

00:17:45.208 --> 00:17:47.583
Nagi, the Others are coming.

00:17:50.083 --> 00:17:51.125
For real?

00:17:51.125 --> 00:17:54.833
2ND LIEUTENANT NAOMI RANDALL
POWER: CLAIRVOYANCE

00:17:58.791 --> 00:18:00.416
We can do it.

00:18:00.416 --> 00:18:01.708
Trust me.

00:18:15.125 --> 00:18:16.791
What was that?

00:18:17.958 --> 00:18:18.875
It's here!

00:18:41.791 --> 00:18:43.333
Pull yourself together.

00:18:44.666 --> 00:18:45.833
"2ND LIEUTENANT KASANE RANDALL"
POWER: TELEKINESIS

00:18:45.833 --> 00:18:48.875
Do you want to die on your first day?

00:18:59.125 --> 00:19:00.208
Let's go.

00:19:16.416 --> 00:19:17.625
Do it now.

00:19:17.625 --> 00:19:19.416
Get crushed!

00:19:42.541 --> 00:19:44.708
You must live on.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.833
Kasane.

00:19:47.833 --> 00:19:49.166
Nagi!

00:19:50.916 --> 00:19:52.375
I'm glad you are all right.

00:19:52.375 --> 00:19:54.916
Naomi saved me.

00:19:57.291 --> 00:20:01.583
Because of Private Yuito Sumeragi's outstanding
performance on his first day,

00:20:01.583 --> 00:20:03.791
the Other was successfully eliminated.

00:20:03.791 --> 00:20:07.041
Private Sumeragi acquired an undeniable victory.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:09.916
Well...

00:20:09.916 --> 00:20:11.583
All right.

00:20:11.583 --> 00:20:14.708
"CAPTAIN ARASHI SPRING, POWER: HYPERVELOCITY"
That's all for the interview.

00:20:14.708 --> 00:20:17.791
It's Captain Arashi Spring.

00:20:20.416 --> 00:20:21.916
Let's go.

00:20:24.208 --> 00:20:25.625
Captain Spring.

00:20:25.625 --> 00:20:28.041
How did you do today?

00:20:28.041 --> 00:20:31.625
Yeah! I gave it my best just now.

00:20:35.791 --> 00:20:38.416
"LIEUTENANT COLONEL LUKA TRAVERS"
Getting the media's attention on your first day,

00:20:38.416 --> 00:20:39.833
"POWER: TELEPORTATION"
that must be rough.

00:20:39.833 --> 00:20:41.791
Lieutenant Colonel Luka Travers.

00:20:41.791 --> 00:20:44.000
The Sixth Class of Septentrions...

00:20:46.458 --> 00:20:51.000
The Others that appeared here
killed two of our soldiers.

00:20:53.375 --> 00:20:55.958
It's best that you don't look.

00:20:55.958 --> 00:20:58.125
The head is still missing.

00:20:58.125 --> 00:21:01.125
Others eat human brains.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:03.791
Human brains...

00:21:10.541 --> 00:21:14.958
There was too much that we didn't know.

00:21:14.958 --> 00:21:19.416
We always thought the Others were merely
a different form of disaster.

00:21:19.416 --> 00:21:24.500
But the daily life threatened by the Others

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:27.208
was brewing a greater conspiracy.

00:21:29.208 --> 00:21:31.791
The only that should perish...

00:21:33.083 --> 00:21:35.458
is this crazy country.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:40.541
What I didn't understand the most...

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.625
was me.
